{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>ומשנאתו אותם.</b> That is: or perhaps it was not in His mind to give them the land, but He enticed them with words until He brought them out of Egypt and killed them, for He hated them, as it is said: ״הנה מפתיה והולכתיה המדבר והמחיה בצמא״. And in Talmudic language there are many vavs that stand in place of 'or,' such as ״חלץ ועשה מאמר ביבמתו״ — which means 'or made a ma'amar with her.'"], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:00:42.651803302Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}